{
  "id": "the-smoke",
  "title": "The Smoke",
  "description": "A GTA-inspired London crime sandbox, starting in Hackney: Covenant-style exploding dice with nine street stats, Hustle and five-star Heat; Altered Carbon-style vehicles, boarding and chases across a linked atlas of 20 traced North and East London street maps; live pirate radio in cars and on the Blower, with Message the studio to send shout-outs to the real stations; Street Life, emergency-service shifts and Auntie Pat's bike orders; speed-dice combat with ranges, cover, ammo, Take hit or Dodge, and police who fight back; a GM Screen of roll requests, hazards and street events; 171 items with their own art, shops, local services and safehouses; first aid, rest and advances; a Character Creator and levelling wizard; and The Chainring campaign with a twelve-mission Mission Board, documented in twelve styled guides.",
